{"id":"chemy34-5-1","sourceHash":"fb6a9d8761123bcba246a353d8f9b9dfce95e49cd75aa6963df5b841232f2f5e","links":[{"concept":"金属氢化物的制备","aliases":[],"subquestions":["1-1"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.97,"reason":"Mg还原CaO并在H2中使Ca转为CaH2，制备生氢剂。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"CaO + Mg + H2 = MgO + CaH2"}]},{"concept":"铀盐的热分解","aliases":[],"subquestions":["1-2"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.97,"reason":"铀酰碳酸铵内氧化还原热解为UO2，同时放NH3/N2/CO2/水。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"3(NH4)4[UO2(CO3)3] = 3UO2 + N2 + 10NH3 + 9CO2 + 9H2O"}]},{"concept":"铀氧化物的氯化","aliases":[],"subquestions":["1-3"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.97,"reason":"UO2与CCl4在低温形成CO2，高温形成CO/Cl2，需据气体摩尔数写两式。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"高温：UO2 + 2CCl4 = UCl4 + 2CO + 2Cl2"}]},{"concept":"硫代硫酸盐的氧化还原反应","aliases":[],"subquestions":["1-4"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.97,"reason":"冰冷H2O2氧化S2O3²-生成S3O6²-和SO4²-且pH不变，需配平。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"2Na2S2O3 + 4H2O2 = Na2SO4 + Na2S3O6 + 4H2O"}]},{"concept":"二氧化氯的制备","aliases":[],"subquestions":["1-5"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.97,"reason":"KClO3与浓硫酸熔融反应生成ClO2、KClO4及焦硫酸盐，冷却难溶物帮助判定。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"3KClO3 + 2H2SO4 = 2ClO2 + KClO4 + K2S2O7 + 2H2O"}]}],"promptVersion":"knowledge-multimodal-v1","model":"codex-source-review","reviewMethod":"Direct AI reading of source text and question/answer images.","analyzedAt":"2026-10-20T01:29:06.858632+00:00"}